{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And if he entices.</b> He speaks to her heart until she listens to him. And thus its Targum: וַאֲרֵי יְשַׁדֵּל — שִׁדּוּל in Aramaic is like פִּתּוּי in Hebrew." "<b>He shall surely give a bride-price.</b> He shall fix for her a bride-price as is the law of a man for his wife — that he writes her a ketubbah and marries her (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:54.257573764Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}